        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5050BRL, Breslin Lever with Modern Square Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Breslin Lever with Square Rosette is a wonderful choice to modernize any space. Its contemporary look stems from the sleek appearance of the lever and, when paired with the square rose, this leverset is a modern designer's dream. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Breslin Lever with Modern Square Rosette is available in either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset; and can fit doors 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick. Choose from several popular finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-BRL-specifications.gif?v=1704354735\" width=\"600\" height=\"132\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Breslin Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Contemporary Breslin Door Lever with Modern Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Breslin Leverset with Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-BRL-specifications.pdf?v=1704262369\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek Breslin Lever Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Breslin Lever with Square Rosette",
                "description": "The Breslin Lever with Square Rosette is a wonderful choice to modernize any space. Its contemporary look stems from the sleek appearance of the lever and, when paired with the square rose, this leverset is a modern designer's dream. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Breslin Lever with Modern Square Rosette is available in either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset; and can fit doors 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick. Choose from several popular finishes.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Modern Breslin Leverset with Square Roses, Contemporary Breslin Door Lever with Modern Square Roses, Breslin Lever with Modern Square Rosettes, Breslin Lever with Square Rosettes, Emtek 5050BRL dummy levers, Emtek 5110BRL passage levers, Emtek 5210BRL privacy levers, EMT-5050BRL, EMT-5110BRL, EMT-5210BRL"
